# Paired with services/data_ingestion/Dockerfile — BuildKit reads this instead
# of the repo-root .dockerignore (see ERRORS.md: a Dockerfile and its
# <name>.dockerignore are a pair). The root file excludes both directories this
# image needs (services/data_ingestion/, bess-marketdata-ingestion/), so the
# data-ingestion image must carry its own ignore file without those exclusions.
.git
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
.env
.venv
venv/
**/node_modules/
data/
debug/
logs/
knowledge/
